<title>USA: Quanex sees record year at MacSteel unit.</title>
<headline>Quanex sees record year at MacSteel unit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quanex Corp said on Thursday that it expected another record year at its MacSteel unit in 1997 as a result of increased capacity and efficiency.</p>
<p>MacSteel, a steel bar and sheet producer, achieved higher levels of production and productivity during the year.</p>
<p>The company said improvements have had a positive impact on its aluminium casting and cold-rolling operations.</p>
<p>However, Quanex expects sluggish demand during winter for aluminium building products.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
